Salesforce Setup mein:

```text
Setup
  ↓
Quick Find
  ↓
Apex Jobs
```

Yahan tum asynchronous Apex jobs ko monitor kar sakte ho.

So practical development mein:

```text
System.enqueueJob()
       ↓
Job ID
       ↓
AsyncApexJob
       ↓
Apex Jobs page
```

