# 10. Queueable mein non-primitive data types ka benefit

Ye Queueable ka bahut important advantage hai.

Future methods mein parameters generally primitive types ya collections of primitive types tak restricted hote hain.

Queueable class mein tum member variables mein complex objects rakh sakte ho.

For example:

```apex
public class AccountQueueable implements Queueable {

    private Account accountRecord;

    public AccountQueueable(Account acc) {
        this.accountRecord = acc;
    }

    public void execute(QueueableContext context) {
        insert accountRecord;
    }
}
```

Aur enqueue:

```apex
Account acc = new Account(
    Name = 'Acme'
);

System.enqueueJob(
    new AccountQueueable(acc)
);
```

Conceptually:

```text
Account Object
     ↓
Queueable Constructor
     ↓
Queueable stores it
     ↓
Job Queue
     ↓
execute()
     ↓
Account available
```

Yahi Queueable ko Future methods se zyada flexible banata hai.

