# 20. Org-wide default Queueable delay

Admins Salesforce mein default delay configure kar sakte hain.

Setup:

```text
Setup
 ↓
Apex Settings
 ↓
Default minimum enqueue delay
```

Range:

```text
1–600 seconds
```

Ye un Queueable jobs ke liye default delay provide karta hai jinke `enqueueJob` call mein explicitly delay nahi diya gaya.

Important:

Agar tum explicitly:

```apex
System.enqueueJob(job, 5);
```

delay specify karte ho, to org-wide default delay ignore hota hai.

