# 41. Queueable ka syntax cheat sheet

### Basic Queueable

```apex
public class MyQueueable implements Queueable {

    public void execute(QueueableContext context) {

        // Logic

    }
}
```

### Enqueue

```apex
Id jobId = System.enqueueJob(
    new MyQueueable()
);
```

### With data

```apex
public class MyQueueable implements Queueable {

    private Id recordId;

    public MyQueueable(Id recordId) {
        this.recordId = recordId;
    }

    public void execute(QueueableContext context) {
        // Use recordId
    }
}
```

### Callout

```apex
public class MyQueueable
    implements Queueable, Database.AllowsCallouts {

    public void execute(QueueableContext context) {
        // HTTP callout
    }
}
```

### Chaining

```apex
public void execute(QueueableContext context) {

    // Current job

    System.enqueueJob(
        new NextQueueable()
    );
}
```

### Delay

```apex
System.enqueueJob(
    new MyQueueable(),
    5
);
```

### Testing

```apex
Test.startTest();

System.enqueueJob(
    new MyQueueable()
);

Test.stopTest();

// Assert results
```

