## One-line memory trick 🧠

**Queueable = `Background Job + Job ID + Complex Data + Chaining + Callouts`**

Aur iska basic flow:

```text
Create Class
     ↓
implements Queueable
     ↓
execute()
     ↓
System.enqueueJob()
     ↓
Salesforce Queue
     ↓
Background Execution
     ↓
AsyncApexJob Monitoring
```

**Future se Queueable yaad rakhne ka shortcut:**

> **Future = basic async**
> **Queueable = advanced async with control**
